{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",

  "//": [
    "The site lives in digbig-2026/, not at the repository root. Without this,",
    "Vercel serves the root — which contains only that folder and no index.html —",
    "and every request returns 404. outputDirectory points it at the real site.",
    "",
    "There is no build step: these are hand-written static files.",
    "",
    "Routing is hash-based (/#/plan, /#/photography/lines), so the server only",
    "ever has to serve '/'. No SPA rewrite is needed and none is defined.",
    "",
    "The headers below mirror netlify.toml so the site behaves the same on",
    "either host: media cached hard, markup and code always revalidated."
  ],

  "framework": null,
  "outputDirectory": "digbig-2026",

  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/photos/(.*)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" }]
    },
    {
      "source": "/design/(.*)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" }]
    },
    {
      "source": "/reels/(.*)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" }]
    },
    {
      "source": "/images/(.*)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" }]
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/(.*)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" }]
    },

    {
      "source": "/index.html",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" }]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*).js",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" }]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*).css",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" }]
    },

    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "DENY" },
        { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" },
        { "key": "Permissions-Policy", "value": "geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
